@startuml FSM Architecture - Used vs Unused Components
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E8
  BorderColor #4CAF50
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #2196F3
}
skinparam component.UNUSED {
  BackgroundColor #FFEBEE
  BorderColor #F44336
  FontColor #999999
}
skinparam component.PROBLEMATIC {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  BorderColor #FF9800
}

title FSM Architecture Analysis\nUsed vs Unused Components

package "States (4 Active)" #E8F5E8 {
  component "evaluating.js" as EVAL #E3F2FD
  component "exploring.js" as EXPL #E3F2FD
  component "idleAtBase.js" as IDLE #E3F2FD
  component "collecting.js" as COLL #FFEBEE
  note right of COLL : ❌ UNUSED\nNever transitioned to
}

package "Events (Mixed Usage)" #FFF3E0 {
  component "systemEvents.js" as SYS_EV #E3F2FD
  component "movementEvents.js" as MOV_EV #FFF3E0
  component "resourceEvents.js" as RES_EV #FFEBEE
  component "userEvents.js" as USER_EV #E3F2FD
  component "emergencyEvents.js" as EMR_EV #E3F2FD
  component "fuelEvents.js" as FUEL_EV #FFEBEE
  
  note right of SYS_EV : ✅ USED\n• EVALUATION_COMPLETE\n• AUTO\n• PROSPECTING_COMPLETE
  note right of MOV_EV : ⚠️ PARTIAL\n• MOVEMENT_STARTED ✅\n• MOVEMENT_PROGRESS ✅\n• BASE_REACHED ❌
  note right of RES_EV : ❌ UNUSED\n• RESOURCE_COLLECTED\n• INVENTORY_FULL
  note right of USER_EV : ✅ AVAILABLE\n• MANUAL_OVERRIDE\n• EXPLORATION_REQUESTED
  note right of EMR_EV : ✅ AVAILABLE\n• EMERGENCY_DETECTED
  note right of FUEL_EV : ❌ UNUSED\n• REFUEL_COMPLETE\n• LOW_FUEL_DETECTED
}

package "Guards (Mixed Usage)" #FFF3E0 {
  component "safety.js" as SAFE_G #E3F2FD
  component "efficiency.js" as EFF_G #E3F2FD  
  component "discovery.js" as DISC_G #E3F2FD
  component "base.js" as BASE_G #FFF3E0
  
  note right of SAFE_G : ✅ USED\n• needsEmergencyReturn\n• isCriticalFuel
  note right of EFF_G : ✅ USED\n• shouldReturnForEfficiency\n• isAtMaxCapacity
  note right of DISC_G : ✅ USED\n• hasUnexploredAreas\n• canStartExploration
  note right of BASE_G : ⚠️ PROBLEMATIC\n• isAtBase (not working?)\n• canRefuel\n• isReadyToLeaveBase
}

package "Reducers (Well Used)" #E8F5E8 {
  component "context.js" as CTX_R #E3F2FD
  note right of CTX_R : ✅ EXTENSIVELY USED\n• state.prepareEvaluating\n• state.prepareExploring\n• movement.startMovement\n• All exploration reducers
}

package "Actions (Mixed Usage)" #FFF3E0 {
  component "explorationActions.js" as EXPL_A #E3F2FD
  component "droneActions.js" as DRONE_A #E3F2FD
  component "movementActions.js" as MOV_A #E3F2FD
  component "resourcesActions.js" as RES_A #FFEBEE
  component "fuelActions.js" as FUEL_A #FFEBEE
  
  note right of EXPL_A : ✅ HEAVILY USED\n• All exploration logic\n• Discovery management
  note right of DRONE_A : ✅ HEAVILY USED\n• fsmDroneFleetActions\n• Deployment logic
  note right of MOV_A : ✅ USED\n• Position updates\n• Movement tracking
  note right of RES_A : ❌ MOSTLY UNUSED\n• Collection logic\n• Inventory management
  note right of FUEL_A : ❌ MOSTLY UNUSED\n• Refuel operations\n• Fuel management
}

' === RELATIONSHIPS ===
EVAL --> SYS_EV : Uses
EVAL --> SAFE_G : Uses
EVAL --> EFF_G : Uses
EVAL --> DISC_G : Uses

EXPL --> SYS_EV : Uses
EXPL --> MOV_EV : Uses (partially)
EXPL --> DRONE_A : Uses
EXPL --> EXPL_A : Uses

IDLE --> SYS_EV : Uses
IDLE --> BASE_G : Uses
IDLE --> FUEL_A : Should use

COLL --> RES_EV : Would use
COLL --> RES_A : Would use

' === PROBLEM AREAS ===
note as Problems
**IDENTIFIED PROBLEMS:**

🔴 **Missing Functionality:**
• BASE_REACHED event not triggered
• Resource collection flow unused
• Fuel management inactive

⚠️ **Incomplete Implementations:**
• Movement events partially working
• Base guards may have issues
• No timeout mechanisms

✅ **Working Well:**
• Exploration flow (deploy→prospect→return)
• State transitions (except return completion)
• Emergency and manual overrides
• Context management and reducers
end note

' === RECOMMENDATIONS ===
note as Recommendations
**RECOMMENDATIONS:**

1. **Fix BASE_REACHED Issue:**
   - Debug why BASE_REACHED never triggers
   - Add fallback timeout for exploring_returning
   - Add position-based completion check

2. **Comment Out Unused Components:**
   - Resource collection states/events
   - Fuel management (if not needed)
   - Unused guards and actions

3. **Add Missing Features:**
   - Timeout mechanisms for stuck states
   - Better error handling
   - State recovery mechanisms

4. **Optimize Used Components:**
   - Exploration flow works well
   - Keep emergency systems
   - Maintain manual override capability
end note

@enduml
